 Christi, 190, 222.</ITEM> <CAPTION COM="1845">I</CAPTION> <ITEM>Ideae in mundi creatione nullae fuerunt, 1.</ITEM> <ITEM>Idololatriae nomen ubi primo ponit Scriptura, 42. Idololatria
